      "widgets_values": [
        "Show the required change and result as a clearly different procedural state when the action has a visible effect. Change the affected objects, parts, connections, layout, or interface as needed; preserve only unaffected details and visual style. Prioritize the requested result over the previous arrangement. Remove any existing words, letters, numbers, labels, captions, annotations, logos, signatures, or watermarks from the reference. Do not render any new text anywhere in the image, including on packaging or interfaces. Explain the step through shapes, positions, and visible changes in one clear, text-free resulting view. Cosmetic variation alone does not count as completing a step. For nonvisual steps, retain the truthful observable state without inventing proof of success."
      ],
